SCRIPT PURPOSE (source saved as 09_independent_checks.py):
- Recompute the trusted rule inventory.
- Compare rule identities, order, multiplicities, spans, hashes, attributes,
  text, classification, and rationale with Stage 3 and Stage 4.
- Recompute all launcher-recorded aggregate hashes using the trusted digest
  functions and all 843 Stage 1 per-file SHA-256 values.
- Compare domain-rule IDs to generated obligation IDs and parse the generated
  target with tools.klean_export.target_statement.

